Meet guitar chords with strumming pattern from Bollywood movie Simran sung by Arijit Singh.

Strumming Pattern : D UDUD UDUD

[F]Kore se panne [A#]jaise ye dil ne

[F]Koi ghazal [A#]Paayi

[F]Pehli baarish [A#]iss zameen pe

[F]Ishq ne [A#]barsaayi

[Dm]Har nazar mein [A#]dhundi jo thi

[Gm]Tujh mein paayi [F]wafa

[Dm]Jaan meri [A#]ban gaya tu

[C]Jaan maine [F]liya

[F]Tu hi mera meet hai [A#]ji

[F]Tu hi meri preet hai [A#]ji

Jo labon se [Dm]ho sake na ju [A#]da

Aisa mera [C]geet hai ji

Tu hi mera [F]meet hai [A#]ji

Tu hi meri [F]preet hai [A#]ji

Jo labon se [Dm]ho sake na ju [A#]da

Aisa mera [C]geet hai [Gm]ji

[C]Tu hi mera [F]meet hai.[A#]..

[F] [A#] [F] [A#] (X2)

[F]Hoo kholun jo aankein

[A#]Subha ko main

[F]Chehra tera hi [Dm]paaun

[F]Ye teri narm si

[A#]Dhoop mein abse

[F]Jahaan ye mera [A#]sajaun

Zara si [Dm]baat pe

Jab [Dm]hasti hai tu

[A#]Hasti hai meri [C]zindagi

[F]Tu hi mera meet hai [A#]ji

[F]Tu hi meri preet hai [A#]ji

Jo labon se [Dm]ho sake na ju [A#]da

Aisa mera [C]geet hai ji

